    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2b400b27e18f6784da1fabf76a038680, type: 3}
    sentenses:
    - Galen!!!
    - "Ghost... I\u2019m scared."
    - "Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll get you out of here."
    - "He won\u2019t go anywhere, not until he tells me where\u2019s the intel he
      stole."
    - "I don\u2019t know what you\u2019re talking about, but you\u2019ll gonna pay
      for this."
    - "Heh\u2026 we\u2019ll see about that.\r\n- Umbrella?\r"
    - On your command sir.
    - ...
    - You bastard.
    - "Anyway, I have to go.\r\n. Let me know when you\u2019re done with him \r"
    - Yes sir.
    - Now you die
    - WHAT!!!
    - Try again
    - "Dammit\u2026How??"
    - You guys have no idea what I am capable of.
    - Let see you can block this
